  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4803.07 Lot Sizes. CO2 allowances shall be made available for sale in lot sizes of 1,000 allowances, except where available supply requires a smaller lot size.\n\nSource. #9284, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9445, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10470, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4803.06); ss by #13974, eff 5-23-24",
